// Records the suite's colour flash demo (demos/probe-dhit.dm3) on zoo, where the player
// starts at (-2352 1568 0) looking down +x. A sentient that takes damage flashes red, or
// green for gas, slime or poison (Sentient::SetOffsetColor: RF_LIGHTOFFSET and the colour
// in constantLight, added to the model's light). Through a camera in front of Julie, she
// is hurt by slime, then by lava: her pain state plays no animation for either
// (julie_torso.st; a 20-point hit from the front throws her out of the picture), but she
// walks on after the lava on both games, so it comes second. Through a camera in front of
// a still creeper further down the corridor, it is hurt, then poisoned (it is immune to
// slime and gas). Then through a camera on Gruff playing stand_smoke_out (an Actor plays
// it only with its AI on): his cigar's tip ("cherry", rgbGen fromentity) glows with the
// entcolor commands of frames 90 to 142. The "demo-flash" check plays it at 10 frames a
// second; made on retail by refresh-retail.ps1. record needs g_syncronousClients
// (fakk2.exe 0x4201f6).
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
spawn Camera targetname "camjulie" origin "-2250 1568 56" angles "10 180 0"
spawn Camera targetname "camcreeper" origin "-1790 1568 70" angles "10 180 0"
spawn Camera targetname "camgruff" origin "-1480 1568 70" angles "5 180 0"
spawn creeper.tik origin "-1950 1568 0" angles "0 0 0" targetname "cr1"
spawn gruff.tik origin "-1600 1568 0" angles "0 0 0" targetname "gruff"
wait 0.5
$cr1 ai_off
stuffcmd "set g_syncronousClients 1"
wait 1
stuffcmd "record probe-dhit"
wait 0.5
cuecamera $camjulie
// 1.5: Julie hurt by slime
wait 1
$player hurt 40 slime
// 3.5: Julie hurt by lava
wait 2
$player hurt 40 lava
// 5.5: the creeper hurt
wait 1.5
cuecamera $camcreeper
wait 0.5
$cr1 hurt 40
// 7.5: the creeper poisoned
wait 2
$cr1 hurt 40 poison
// 9.5: Gruff smoking
wait 2
cuecamera $camgruff
$gruff anim stand_smoke_out
wait 13
stuffcmd "stoprecord"
wait 0.2
stuffcmd "quit"
end
